<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The duration of the moratorium referred to in section 11, unless the administration is sooner terminated under section 6 or paragraph 21(3)(c), shall be for a period of twelve months commencing from the date of the appointment of the Administrator under subsection 5(1)."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_12__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_12> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
