<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_13__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "On the appointment of the Administrator, any transfer, mortgage, execution, attachment, obligation, settlement, charge, assignment, delivery of goods, payment or other act relating to any property made, incurred or done by or against the Administered Companies which, had it been made, incurred or done by or against an individual, would in his bankruptcy under the law of bankruptcy be void or voidable, may be avoided or recoverable by the Administrator."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
