<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to subsection (2), where any person is under a contract or obligation to provide goods or services or both to the Administered Companies, the Administrator may direct such person to provide the goods or services or both to the Malaysia Airlines Berhad and its subsidiary companies instead of the Administered Companies, and the Malaysia Airlines Berhad and its subsidiary companies shall pay for such goods or services or both at the same rate as would have been paid by the Administered Companies."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_14> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
