<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The direction by the Administrator under subsection (1) shall be given only for the purpose of ensuring that the services of the Malaysia Airlines Berhad and its subsidiary companies are not disrupted."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_II__cl_14__subsec_3__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
