<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_24> <https://schema.org/text> "The corporation incorporated under the Companies Act 1965 by the name of “Malaysia Airlines Berhad” shall have the main objective of operating the national carrier of Malaysia and shall carry on the business of the national carrier as a commercial enterprise and such other businesses as the board of directors of the Malaysia Airlines Berhad thinks fit. offer of employment"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
