<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "2" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_2> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A meeting to be convened under subsection (1) shall not proceed unless all of the trade unions and associations are duly represented in the meeting."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "3" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
