<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_7> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
