<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_7> <https://schema.org/text> "In a meeting under this section, where the trade unions and associations unanimously resolve that the matter for discussion or negotiation relates solely to a specific trade union or association, the meeting shall be dissolved and a separate meeting shall be convened between the Malaysia Airlines Berhad and that specific trade union or association."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28__subsec_8> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_IV__cl_28> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
