<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~part_VI__cl_37__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The incorporation of the Malaysia Airlines Berhad and all acts and things done by any person on behalf of the Malaysia Airlines Berhad and all rights and obligations acquired or incurred on behalf of the Malaysia Airlines Berhad shall, upon the coming into operation of this Act, be deemed to be done under this Act and shall be the rights and obligations of the Malaysia Airlines Berhad."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
