<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The transferee shall, on and from the transfer date of the property, acquire and be vested with all of the transferor’s present and future rights, title and interest in, and obligations with respect to, such property, free of any encumbrances save for any registered interest prevailing as at the transfer date."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
