<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "A vesting order stating that a property or liability has been transferred to and vested in the transferee shall be conclusive evidence of such transfer and vesting as of the transfer date."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
