<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@/~sched_1__para_2__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "No provision in any agreement limiting or prohibiting the right of the transferor or requiring any consent to assign, sell, dispose of or transfer of a property shall have any application or effect in respect of the transfer and vesting of the property to the transferee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2014/31/eng@> .
